/// The computer a capture of System Monitor shows: the readings of a laptop at work, so a
/// picture holds a person's machine rather than the one the shots run on.
///
/// A laptop at work: a browser and an editor beside a terminal running a build, with the
/// processor, memory, disk and network readings behind them.
